ain.'\r\nKnown limits: the connector did not retain every request timestamp. A feature rollout, a support import, and a user request can have different timestamps. Missing request dates remain unknown.\r\nOriginal recommendation: retain the current cohort while the outcome matures. Source receipts are attached to record-e76b26291a; any later interpretation must preserve the actual disposition recorded there.\r\n\r\n=== record-bc7e177af3.md ===\r\n# record-bc7e177af3: triage facets observation\r\nAction: record-e10a5c3d48. Alias: weekly note. Revision: record-cd29ee5f7a.13.3.\r\nRetrieved 2026-05-21. Exposure began 2026-05-10; observation window 2026-05-11 through 2026-05-20. Cohort: new Android accounts in Canada. Eligible accounts in this report: 3355.\r\nMeasure: repeat use; definition: accounts returning to the same surface on a second distinct day. Initial estimate versus the matched prior surface: -1.6%. This is an operational estimate from this enrollment, with 15 reviewed recordings and 12 support conversations. It is not a randomized estimate for the entire product population.\r\nRecording notes: people mistook the confirmation for an additional required action. After the change, two participants still expected the previous navigation order. Customer language: 'I use triage facets when checking the team work; I need to know whether the last step finished before I try it again.'\r\nKnown limits: the oldest supported client revision is absent from these recordings. A feature rollout, a support import, and a user request can have different timestamps. Missing request dates remain unknown.\r\nOriginal recommendation: reconcile delayed operation receipts before deciding. Source receipts are attached to record-e10a5c3d48; any later interpretation must preserve the actual disposition recorded there.\r\n\r\n=== record-dc5e36168a.md ===\r\n# record-dc5e36168a: triage facets observation\r\nAction: record-28f51467c8. Alias: weekly note. Revision: record-b88d0e3215.16.0